  "details": "For group instances used in game worlds or events, it may be a good idea for the group to implement a Trust Rank restriction feature to prevent cheaters and disruptive users before they become a problem.\n\nI’m a group administrator myself, and since I’ve been plagued by “Visitor” client users to the point where it’s starting to cut into my sleep, I’d like to make this suggestion.",
